## 🌱人類社會敘事史（1）——從人性開始的心理敘事

社會結構起始於意識的賦義敘事，而意識的賦義敘事起始於載體的心理賦義敘事。心理賦義敘事使得意識的顯化介入成為現實——心理賦義敘事是意識介入現實的具像抓手，是實施敘事的手段、唯一途徑，是使載體「自願」實施意識顯化的敘事技術，是意識得以無消耗進入社會性權力體系的前置條件。心理敘事當然不是社會的「裝飾」或「附屬」，而是社會結構最底層、最原始、貫穿始終的前提敘事(也因此，心理敘事的一舉一動都會触動現實利益分配，從而在現實中無法觸碰而發展緩慢)。

## 🌱Human Social Narrative History (1) — The Psychological Narrative Beginning from Human Nature

Social structure begins with consciousness's meaning-assignment narrative, and consciousness's meaning-assignment narrative begins with the carrier's psychological meaning-assignment narrative. Psychological meaning-assignment narrative makes consciousness's manifestation intervention become reality — it is the concrete grip through which consciousness intervenes in reality, the means and only pathway for implementing narrative, the narrative technique that enables carriers to “voluntarily” carry out conscious manifestation, and the precondition for consciousness to enter the social power system without consumption. Psychological narrative is of course not a “decoration” or “appendix” to society, but the most foundational, most primordial, and most pervasive prerequisite narrative throughout social structure (and precisely because of this, every move of psychological narrative touches real interest allocation, making it untouchable in reality and thus developing slowly).

